# Build context for seeds/Dockerfile.
#
# This one matters more than the root file: seeds/Dockerfile is `COPY . .`, so
# anything not excluded here lands in an image layer. seeds/.env.example tells
# operators to copy it to .env and fill in LLM_API_KEY and CONCLAVE_AGENT_KEY —
# without this file, doing so bakes those into the image.

.git
.gitea
__pycache__
**/__pycache__
*.pyc
.pytest_cache
.ruff_cache

.env
.env.*
!.env.example

tests/
docs/
REVIEW.md
